 "findings": [
  "Q1: HPD spells ordinals out or with a suffix (54TH STREET, SEVENTH AVENUE), PLUTO does not (54 STREET, 7 AVENUE), so rule A2 alone reaches the PLUTO lot from the HPD spelling for only about half of registered buildings (100 of 198 sampled). The expected Q1 answers therefore come through Geosupport (design note 0013): every HPD and PLUTO spelling of the anchors resolves to the BBL and BIN in this file (tests/test_geosupport_live.py).",
